{
  "name": "Order-to-Fulfillment Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. The event\nStripe calls this webhook when a checkout is paid. Nobody clicks anything.\n\nFailure plan: Stripe re-sends automatically for up to 3 days if n8n is down.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0f1d2c3b-4a59-4e6f-8a7b-000000000001",
      "name": "Note: 1 Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Verify, dedupe, claim\nDon't trust the webhook body - fetch the order from Stripe. Skip if we've already seen this order. Write a \"processing\" row straight away so nothing is invisible.\n\nFailure plan: retry 3x (network blips), then alert a human.",
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 760,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0f1d2c3b-4a59-4e6f-8a7b-000000000002",
      "name": "Note: 2 Verify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Inventory\nValidate the order, check stock, reserve it.\n\nOut of stock / bad data is NOT retried - a human decides (restock or refund).",
        "width": 1120,
        "height": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "0f1d2c3b-4a59-4e6f-8a7b-000000000003",
      "name": "Note: 3 Stock",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1960,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Invoice + email\nHTML -> PDF (Gotenberg) -> email with attachment.\n\nFailure plan: retry 3x with a pause, then alert a human.",
        "width": 820,
        "height": 800,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0f1d2c3b-4a59-4e6f-8a7b-000000000004",
      "name": "Note: 4 Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3060,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Every path ends in ONE place\nfulfilled / needs_attention / failed -> one row in the Orders sheet. Anything not fulfilled -> Telegram alert with order, step, reason and what to do.",
        "width": 1860,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "0f1d2c3b-4a59-4e6f-8a7b-000000000005",
      "name": "Note: 5 Outcome",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2800,
        720
